      "cr": 3,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Iron Cordon Brigade packet sheet — Cordon Trench Sapper.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py</code> from the NPC Forge roster <code>data/forge/iron-legion.json</code> (entry <code>cordon-trench-sapper</code>): Medium humanoid (human), Lawful Neutral; CR 3 (proficiency +2, to hit +5 with STR); AC 16 (spiked trench cuirass), hit points 52 (7d8+21), speed 30 ft.. A GM scene kit for the Iron Cordon Brigade article's present (1040 BF), not a filed event; the faction article stays the authority.</p><p>When natural terrain, fortifications, or rogue barricades impede the Legion's advance, Trench Sappers deploy concentrated star-powder charges to breach pathways.</p><p><strong>Role:</strong> combat engineer · <strong>tier:</strong> Demolition Specialist · <strong>folder:</strong> Iron Legion / Frontline Patrol.</p><h3>Art</h3><p><strong>Awaiting its plate.</strong> The render <code>npc-forge/iron-legion/renders/cordon-trench-sapper.png</code> has not been cut yet; run the NPC Forge (or <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py plates iron-legion</code>) and rebuild. Seed 510006. Prompt: <q>Clean cel-shaded character art in the style of dark fantasy military concept art, bold dark outlines, cold iron and gunmetal grey armor, brass gears, glowing cyan star-bit conduits, flat colours, crisp shading. A burly combat engineer in scarred steel breastplate, heavy leather gauntlets, and blast goggles. Carrying a rack of cylindrical explosive charges and a heavy two-handed trench pickaxe with reinforced iron teeth. Full body, whole figure visible, three-quarter view, centred, isolated on a plain flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no floor, no ground shadow, no text, no border.</q></p>",
        "public": ""
      },
